          "text": "Description: On the night of September 21 to 22, 2002, around midnight, a couple of witnesses are awakened by a deep noise that becomes unbearable and ends with three violent explosions. The entire phenomenon lasted approximately 3 seconds. Curiously, their children were not awakened, and their neighbor heard nothing. No further information. Case classified C.",
